# Spec process

Use [docs/templates/change-spec.md](docs/templates/change-spec.md).

- `bug` / `enhancement` that only matches an accepted contract: write the spec and implement. Put the file in `docs/specs/approved/` while in flight, then `docs/specs/shipped/` after tests pass.
- `new_capability` or any Locked/Accepted design-doc edit: write to `docs/specs/proposed/` and stop.
- Cite a Decision Register id, or `none — bug vs accepted contract`.
- Prefer accepted contracts over Draft `docs/systems/combat.md`.
- New capabilities must add a Decision Register row in the same change as the owning spec.
